        <textile-connector:sourceLocator xml:lang="en">JRC Preparatory Study, Section 9.2.2.1, printed page 123, lines 3257-3262; JRC Preparatory Study, Section 9.2.2.2, printed page 125, lines 3315-3316; JRC Preparatory Study, Section 9.2.2.2, printed page 125, lines 3322-3325.</textile-connector:sourceLocator>
